  <!-- EN: rallied -->
  <UMW_Rallied.label>士氣大振</UMW_Rallied.label>

  <!-- EN: Stirred by the rallying cry of a storied weapon's bearer. For a time, wounds barely register, and a hit does little to break their stride. -->
  <UMW_Rallied.description>因傳世武器持有者的鼓舞吶喊而振奮。一段時間內，傷痛幾乎難以察覺，受擊也很難讓其停下腳步。</UMW_Rallied.description>


  <!-- EN: sedative buildup -->
  <UMW_SedativeBuildup.label>鎮靜劑累積</UMW_SedativeBuildup.label>

  <!-- EN: A fast-acting sedative building up in the bloodstream. At high levels it renders creatures unconscious. -->
  <UMW_SedativeBuildup.description>一種在血液中不斷累積的速效鎮靜劑。濃度過高時會使生物失去意識。</UMW_SedativeBuildup.description>

